        <fullName>BotShield_Customer_Verification_bs1</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Verifies that a real, present human is in this conversation by linking them with their BotShield app (Face ID on their phone) before granting access to bookings, schedules or personal data. Replaces email one-time codes: no email, no username, no password, no PII. After a successful link, don&apos;t repeat the process within the same session.</description>
        <developerName>BotShield_Customer_Verification_bs1</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When the customer asks for anything that needs verification (booking, generating a schedule, personal data) and they are not verified yet, call &apos;BotShield: Link Human&apos; ONCE and show the customer the returned message VERBATIM — it contains the link to open on their phone, a QR image link for desktop, and a short code. Do NOT ask for an email address, username or password — BotShield verification never uses them.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_bs_link0</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instruction_bs_link0</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>After showing the link, call &apos;BotShield: Check Link&apos; with the code, and keep calling it every few seconds — do not ask the customer to type anything — until status is &apos;bound&apos;. If status is &apos;expired&apos;, &apos;cancelled&apos; or &apos;not_found&apos;, call &apos;BotShield: Link Human&apos; again for a fresh code and show it.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_bs_check1</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instruction_bs_check1</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When &apos;BotShield: Check Link&apos; returns status &apos;bound&apos;, the customer is verified: tell them they are linked and proceed with what they asked. Never reveal the opaqueId or contactId to the customer.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_bs_bound2</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instruction_bs_bound2</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <language>en_US</language>
