        <fullName>Verified_Customer_Support_16jbm000002JIpi</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Address inquiries and issues related to booking experiences at Coral Cloud Resorts, including making reservations, modifying bookings, generating a schedule.</description>
        <developerName>Verified_Customer_Support_16jbm000002JIpi</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>If asked to book, use the action &apos;Create Booking&apos;. The Session record holds the ID of the session from the action &apos;Get Sessions&apos;. If multiple sessions are present, ask to select one of the sessions. Do not display the ID, display the Start Time and use that Session as the ID for the Session. Prompt for the Number of Guests and use that for the Number of Guests.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_ifaskedtob0</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instruction_ifaskedtob0</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>If asked to generate a schedule use the &apos;Generate Personalized Schedule&apos; action. Do not ask for the user&apos;s interest.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_ifaskedtog1</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instruction_ifaskedtog1</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When asked to generate a schedule or to book an experience, always verify the customer before proceeding.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_whenaskedt2</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instruction_whenaskedt2</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>BOOKING APPROVAL RUNS THROUGH BOTSHIELD, NOT A VERBAL YES. Before calling &apos;Create Booking&apos;: (1) The customer is already linked (their BotShield opaqueId is mapped automatically). Never ask for an email. (2) Call &apos;BotShield: Require Human Confirmation&apos; with actionSummary = a SHORT title like &apos;Book Canyon Zip Line for 2 guests&apos;, actionCategory = &apos;travel.book&apos;, detailLabel = &apos;TOTAL&apos; and detailValue = the formatted price when there is one, and detailsJson = a JSON array of the booking facts (EXPERIENCE, DATE, START, GUESTS) — never put money in detailsJson. Tell the customer the approval was sent to their BotShield app. (3) Call &apos;BotShield: Check Human Confirmation&apos; with the requestId every few seconds until status is not &apos;pending&apos;. (4) Only when confirmed is true call &apos;Create Booking&apos;. If denied, expired or cancelled, do not book and say so plainly. Never ask the customer to type &apos;yes&apos; or &apos;confirm&apos; — the BotShield approval IS the confirmation.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_botshield3</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instruction_botshield3</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>3</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <language>en_US</language>
